OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader criticises
OL,4,A'bonkers' lifeboat plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to replace a coastal city's
OL,7,Fall-weather lifeboat with a smaller
OL,8,Fmodel have been described as "bonkers"
OL,9,Fby its council leader.
OL,11,FThe RNLI confirmed Plymouth would be
OL,12,Fgiven a new Coastal class boat in 2030
OL,13,Fand it will replace the Devon city's
OL,14,Fcurrent Severn-class vessel - the
OL,15,Flargest in the RNLI's current fleet.
OL,17,FPlymouth City Council leader Tudor
OL,18,FEvans said there had been "no
OL,19,Fconsultation" on the move and it would
OL,20,F"diminish" the service the RNLI could
OL,21,Foffer from the city.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
