OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader criticises
OL,4,A'bonkers' lifeboat plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RNLI said the decision was based on
OL,7,Fanalysis of more than 81,000 rescues
OL,8,Fnationally since 2017 and reflected how
OL,9,Fpeople were increasingly getting into
OL,10,Fdifficulty closer to shore.
